message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "BlockGeo-QEM"
abstract: >-
  Python code of BlockGeo-QEM, a quantum error-mitigation method in which a neural network
  maps measured two-qubit block marginals of a qubit chain to density matrices and is trained
  with the Bures distance. It contains the simulation pipeline, the baselines, the analysis
  scripts and IBM Quantum hardware measurements.
